azure|entra-id|text|gh|acumatica-ci-cd|AZURE_TENANT_ID
azure|entra-id|username|gh|acumatica-ci-cd|AZURE_CLIENT_ID
azure|entra-id|password|gh|acumatica-ci-cd|AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET
azure|entra-id|text|rw|studiob-platform/studiob-api|AZURE_TENANT_ID
azure|entra-id|username|rw|studiob-platform/studiob-api|AZURE_CLIENT_ID
azure|entra-id|password|rw|studiob-platform/studiob-api|AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET
azure|entra-id|text|rw|aesthetik-production/heritage-wms|ENTRA_TENANT_ID
